/24-DSC_0397.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/24-DSC_0397-1080x608.jpg\" alt=\"24-DSC_0397\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><figcaption>Соберись!</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/25-DSC_0400.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/25-DSC_0400-1080x608.jpg\" alt=\"25-DSC_0400\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><figcaption>Выше!</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/26-DSC_0405.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/26-DSC_0405-1080x608.jpg\" alt=\"26-DSC_0405\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><figcaption>Почти наверху!</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/27-DSC_0420.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/27-DSC_0420-1080x608.jpg\" alt=\"27-DSC_0420\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><figcaption>Самый младший в команде</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/29-DSC_0462.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/29-DSC_0462-608x1080.jpg\" alt=\"29-DSC_0462\" width=\"608\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><figcaption>Саша пробует скалу</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/31-DSC_0479.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\"><img class=\"size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/31-DSC_0479-512x1080.jpg\" alt=\"31-DSC_0479\" width=\"512\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a><figcaption>Кристина делает это легко!</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/28-DSC_0427.jpg\" rel=\"no